  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, saute the chopped onion, carrot, and celery in a little water until they are tender.",
    "Add the crumbled tempeh and cook for about 5 minutes, stirring occasionally, until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the red lentils, vegetable broth, nutritional yeast, tomato paste, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for about 30 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the soup to your desired consistency.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the mercimek corbasi hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Let it cool completely before refrigerating or freezing for later use."
